mber+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+statements+revealed+a+Net%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDukhan+Bank+discloses+the+interim+financial+statement+for+the+nine-month+period+ending+30th+September+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+statements+revealed+a+Net+Profit+of+QR++1%2C192%2C424%2C000+in+comparison+to+Net+Profit+QR++1%2C191%2C592%2C000+for+the+same+period+of+the+previous+year.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Earnings+per+Share%28EPS%29+amounted+to+QR++0.215+as+of+30th+September+%2C+2026versus+Earnings+per+Share%28EPS%29+QR++0.215+for+the+same+period+in+2025+.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D1ab1185e-ed99-46bd-93d8-fece5b0bc5a1%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-10-07T13%3A39%3A26%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-10-07T13%3A39%3A26%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46946%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3E+AlRayan+Bank%3A+Announcement+of+Signing+a+Cooperation+Agreement+with+Edaa+to+Enable+Digital+National+Investor+Number+Services%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAlRayan+Bank+%28Q.P.S.C.%29+announces+the+signing+of+a+cooperation+agreement+with+Edaa+making+it+the+first+bank+in+Qatar+to+enable+its+customers+to+submit%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAlRayan+Bank+%28Q.P.S.C.%29+announces+the+signing+of+a+cooperation+agreement+with+Edaa+making+it+the+first+bank+in+Qatar+to+enable+its+customers+to+submit+requests+for+the+issuance+of+a+National+Investor+Number+and+update+shareholder+information+with+Edaa+directly+through+the+bank%2C+using+a+dedicated+electronic+system.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D0903b022-81b8-41f1-8d79-7259b04a19dd%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-10-06T13%3A55%3A50%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-10-06T13%3A55%3A50%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46944%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatari+German+Co.+for+Medical+Devices+%3A+Disclosure+Regarding+the+Judgment+Issued+in+the+Lawsuit+Related+to+the+Complaint+Filed+by+the+Company+Concerning+Suspected+Mismanagement+During+the+Period+from+2021+to+2024%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatari+German+Co.+for+Medical+Devices+announced+the+issuance+of+a+judgment+in+Case+No.+%282026%2F3298%2FMiscellaneous+Misdemeanors%2FFirst+Instance%29.The+Crim%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatari+German+Co.+for+Medical+Devices+announced+the+issuance+of+a+judgment+in+Case+No.+%282026%2F3298%2FMiscellaneous+Misdemeanors%2FFirst+Instance%29.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Criminal+Court+of+First+Instance+issued+its+judgment+on+01%2F10%2F2026+in+favor+of+the+Company+in+the+case+filed+against+the+Company%E2%80%99s+former+management+for+the+period+from+2021+to+2024.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+first-instance+judgment+found+the+former+Finance+Manager%2C+who+served+during+the+period+from+15%2F12%2F2019+to+31%2F12%2F2023%2C+guilty+and+sentenced+him+to+six+months%E2%80%99+imprisonment+and+a+fine+of+QAR+10%2C000+in+respect+of+the+charges+brought+against+him.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BIt+should+also+be+noted+that+the+judgment+issued+is+a+first-instance+judgment+and%2C+therefore%2C+remains+subject+to+appeal+by+all+parties+in+accordance+with+the+procedures+and+time+limits+prescribed+by+law.+The+judgment+relates+to+the+complaint+filed+by+the+Company+under+No.+%282026%2F1303%2FEconomic+Crimes+Department%29%2C+which+was+previously+disclosed+on+22%2F02%2F2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-10-06T07%3A44%3A25%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-10-06T07%3A44%3A25%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46942%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EAamal+will+hold+its+investors+relation+conference+call+on+29%2F10%2F2026+to+discuss+the+financial+results%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAamal+announces+that+the+conference+call+with+the+Investors+to+discuss+the+financial+results+for+the+Quarter+3+2026+will+be+held+on+29%2F10%2F2026+at+02%3A0