gt%3BMekdam+Holding+Group+announced+that+its+subsidiary%2C+Mekdam+Technical+Services+W.L.L.%2C+has+received+a+Letter+of+Award+from+the+Public+Works+Authority+%28Ashghal%29+in+relation+to+a+tender+for+the+provision+and+secondment+of+specialized+professional+personnel+to+the+Designs+Department.+According+to+the+Letter+of+Award%2C+the+project+will+run+for+three+years+from+the+commencement+date%2C+or+until+the+total+value+of+issued+mobilization+orders+reaches%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22font-size%3A12pt%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22direction%3Artl%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22unicode-bidi%3Aembed%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22line-height%3A115%25%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22font-family%3AAptos%2Csans-serif%22%26gt%3BQAR+262.5+million%2C%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B+whichever+occurs+first.%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22font-family%3A+%27times+new+roman%27%2C+times%2C+serif%3B%22%26gt%3BThis+award+carries+particular+significance+amid+a+regional+environment+characterized+by+elevated+levels+of+uncertainty.+It+represents+an+important+addition+to+the+Group%E2%80%99s+project+portfolio+and+contributes+to+enhancing+visibility+over+future+business+volumes+and+continuity+in+the+coming+years%2C+particularly+within+the+technical+services+and+specialized+professional+staffing+segment.+The+award+also+reflects+continued+demand+for+the+Group%E2%80%99s+services+and+its+ability+to+maintain+business+momentum%2C+supporting+its+strategy+of+balanced+growth+and+the+expansion+of+its+long-term+project+base.+Mekdam+Holding+Group+believes+that+its+continued+ability+to+add+strategic+projects+to+its+portfolio%2C+despite+the+broader+challenges+affecting+the+business+environment%2C+demonstrates+the+resilience+of+its+operating+model%2C+the+diversification+of+its+activities%2C+and+its+ability+to+adapt+to+changing+conditions+while+sustaining+growth.+The+Group+will+continue+to+strengthen+its+operational+capabilities+and+expand+its+participation+in+government+and+strategic+projects%2C+supporting+business+stability+and+enhancing+its+readiness+to+capitalize+on+growth+opportunities+in+the+Qatari+market+during+the+coming+period.%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22font-family%3A+%27times+new+roman%27%2C+times%2C+serif%3B%22%26gt%3BThe+contractual+procedures+will+be+completed+in+accordance+with+the+tender+requirements+and+relevant+documentation%2C+paving+the+way+for+contract+signing+and+commencement+of+the+project.%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-10-04T07%3A30%3A00%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-10-04T07%3A58%3A27%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46914%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Islamic+Bank+will+hold+its+investors+relation+conference+call+on+15%2F10%2F2026+to+discuss+the+financial+results%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Islamic+Bank+announces+that+the+conference+call+with+the+Investors+to+discuss+the+financial+results+for+the+Quarter+3+2026+will+be+held+on+15%2F10%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Islamic+Bank+announces+that+the+conference+call+with+the+Investors+to+discuss+the+financial+results+for+t