Date%3E2026-09-30T13%3A46%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A46%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46902%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3ENational+Leasing+Holding%3A+To+disclose+its+Quarter+3+financial+results+on+14%2F10%2F2026%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3ENational+Leasing+Holding+discloses+its+financial+statement+for+the+period+ending+30th+September+2026+on+14%2F10%2F2026.%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BNational+Leasing+Holding+discloses+its+financial+statement+for+the+period+ending+30th+September+2026+on+14%2F10%2F2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A46%3A20%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A46%3A20%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46900%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQNB+Capital+acts+as+Global+Coordinator+on+the+State+of+Qatar%E2%80%99s+US%243+billion+dual-tranche+bond+issuance%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQNB+Group%2C+a+leading+financial+institution+in+the+Middle+East+and+Africa%2C+announces+that+QNB+Capital+successfully+acted+as+Global+Coordinator+on+the+S%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQNB+Group%2C+a+leading+financial+institution+in+the+Middle+East+and+Africa%2C+announces+that+QNB+Capital+successfully+acted+as+Global+Coordinator+on+the+State+of+Qatar%E2%80%99s+US%243+billion+dual-tranche+conventional+bond+issuance+in+the+international+debt+capital+markets.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BHighlights%3A%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%B7+The+transaction%2C+priced+on+21+September+2026%2C+comprised+a+US%241+billion+five-year+bond+and+a+US%242+billion+ten-year+bond.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%B7+The+five-year+tranche+was+priced+at+55+basis+points+over+US+Treasuries%2C+with+a+coupon+of+5.25%25+and+a+yield+to+maturity+of+5.38%25.+The+tranche+attracted+an+order+book+exceeding+US%242+billion%2C+representing+demand+of+more+than+twice+the+amount+issued.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%B7+The+ten-year+tranche+was+priced+at+65+basis+points+over+US+Treasuries%2C+with+a+coupon+of+5.375%25+and+a+yield+to+maturity+of+5.613%25.+Investor+orders+for+the+tranche+exceeded+US%244+billion%2C+also+representing+demand+of+more+than+twice+the+amount+issued.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%B7These+spreads+represent+the+additional+return+offered+to+investors+over+comparable+US+government+bonds.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+strong+demand+across+both+maturities+enabled+the+State+of+Qatar+to+price+each+tranche+with+a+new+issue+premium+of+only+five+basis+points+above+fair+value.+This+represented+one+of+the+lowest+new+issue+premiums+achieved+across+comparable+regional+transactions+in+2026%2C+underscoring+continued+international+investor+confidence+in+Qatar%E2%80%99s+strong+credit+fundamentals+and+economic+outlook.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+transaction+attracted+demand+from+a+diversified+base+of+institutional+investors+across+Asia%2C+Europe%2C+the+Middle+East+and+Africa%2C+and+the+United+States%2C+including+asset+managers%2C+banks%2C+pension+funds%2C+insurance+companies+and+sovereign+wealth+funds.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BCommenting+on+the+transaction%2C+Abdulla+Mubarak+Al-Khalifa%2C+Group+Chief+Executive+Officer+of+QNB+Group%2C+said%3A+%E2%80%9CQNB+Capital+is+proud+to+have+supported+the+State+of+Qatar+in+the+successful+execution+of+this+important+international+bond+issuance.+The+strong+investor+demand+and+competitive+pricing+achieved+across+both+tranches+reflect+the+continued+confidence+of+global+investors+in+Qatar%E2%80%99s+economy+and+credit+fundamentals.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+transaction+also+demonstrates+QNB+Group%E2%80%99s+ability+to+combine+QNB+Capital%E2%80%99s+debt+capital+markets+expertise+with+the+strength+of+our+international+network+and+global+investor+relationships.+We+remain+committed+to+supporting+the+State+of+Qatar+and+our+clients+in+accessing+international+capital+markets+and+delivering+transactions+aligned+with+their+strategic+financing+objectives.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQNB+Capital+acted+as+Global+Coordinator+alongside+J.P.+Morgan%2C+HSBC%2C+Standard+Chartered+Bank+and+Goldman+Sachs.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BSantander%2C+Cr%C3%A9dit+Agricole+Corporate+and+Investment+Bank%2C+Deutsche+Bank%2C+Mizuho%2C+MUFG+and+SMBC+acted+as+Joint+Bookrunners.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+transaction+further+strengthens+QNB+Capital%E2%80%99s+track+record+in+executing+landmark+sovereign+and+institutional+debt+capital+markets+transactions+and+reinforces+its+position+as+a+leading+investment+banking+adviser+in+Qatar+and+across+the+region.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BAbout+QNB+Group%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQNB+Group+is+a+leading+financial+institution+in+the+Middle+East+and+Africa+and+one+of+the+most+valuable+banking+brands+in+the+region.+Present+in+more+than+28+countries+across+Asia%2C+Europe+and+Africa%2C+it+offers+tailored+products+and+services+supported+by+innovation+and+backed+by+a+team+of+over+31%2C000+professionals+dedicated+to+driving+banking+excellence+worldwide.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BAbout+QNB+Capital%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstablished+in+2008%2C+QNB+Capital+is+the+investment+banking+arm+of+QNB+Group+and+a+leading+provider+of+investment+banking+and+financial+advisory+services+across+regional+and+international+markets.+Headquartered+in+Doha%2C+with+offices+in+London+and+Paris%2C+QNB+Capital+advises+sovereigns%2C+government+entities%2C+corporations%2C+family+offices%2C+private+equity+firms+and+institutional+investors+on+complex+transactions+across+mergers+and+acquisitions%2C+capital+markets%2C+project+finance%2C+structured+solutions%2C+and+real+estate.+Its+deep+market+knowledge%2C+experienced+advisory+team+and+access+to+QNB+Group%E2%80%99s+extensive+international+network+enable+it+to+provide+independent+expert+advice+and+high-quality+execution+across+multiple+markets.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A28%3A09%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A28%3A10%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46898%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3ENakilat+Adds+Latest+LPG%2FAmmonia+Vessel+to+its+Fleet%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EDoha%2C+Qatar%2C+%5BSep+30%2C+2026%5D%3A+Qatar+Gas+Transport+Company+Limited+%28Nakilat%29+celebrated+the+naming+of+the+latest+LPG%2FAmmonia+carrier+to+join+its+fleet+d%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDoha%2C+Qatar%2C+%5BSep+30%2C+2026%5D%3A+Qatar+Gas+Transport+Company+Limited+%28Nakilat%29+celebrated+the+naming+of+the+latest+LPG%2FAmmonia+carrier+to+join+its+fleet+during+a+special+ceremony+held+at+the+HD+Hyundai+Samho+shipyard+in+Yeongam%2C+South+Korea.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+new+vessel+%E2%80%9CEnergy+North%E2%80%9D%2C+which+is+set+to+enter+service+on+the+second+of++October+2026%2C+is+the+first+under+Nakilat%27s+program+to+build+six+new+vessels+at+the+HD+Hyundai+Samho+shipyard%2C+comprising+two+LNG+carriers+and+four+LPG%2Fammonia+carriers.+This+investment+reflects+Nakilat%27s+commitment+to+strengthening+its+operational+capabilities+and+meeting+the+growing+demand+for+energy+transport+services+in+global+markets.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BCommenting+on+the+occasion%2C+Mr.+Abdullah+Al+Sulaiti%2C+the+Chief+Executive+Officer+of+Nakilat%2C+said%3A+%E2%80%9CThe+addition+of+the+first+vessel+under+Nakilat%E2%80%99s+fleet+expansion+program+marks+another+important+milestone+in+our+journey+and+reflects+continued+commitment+to+developing+a+modern+and+diversified+fleet+capable+of+supporting+the+global+energy+transportation+sector+efficiently+and+reliably.+This+achievement+also+embodies+our+vision+to+strengthen+Nakilat%E2%80%99s+position+as+a+trusted+leading+global+partner+in+maritime+transportation.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BMr.+Al-Sulaiti+added%3A+%E2%80%9CThis+achievement+also+highlights+the+strength+of+our+collaboration+with+HD+Hyundai+Samho+and+the+dedication+of+all+project+teams+involved+in+progressing+these+vessels+to+this+important+stage.+Nakilat+remains+focused+on+operational+excellence%2C+innovation%2C+and+long-term+sustainable+growth.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%E2%80%9CEnergy+North%E2%80%9D+has+a+cargo+capacity+of+88%2C000+cubic+meters%2C+specifically+designed+to+transport+both+LPG+and+ammonia+safely+and+efficiently.+Equipped+with+advanced+dual-fuel+propulsion+technology+and+emissions-reduction+systems%2C+the+vessel+offers+enhanced+fuel+efficiency%2C+operational+flexibility%2C+and+superior+environmental+performance.+Its+ammonia-ready+design+supports+the+evolving+global+energy+landscape+and+positions+the+vessels+to+play+a+key+role+in+future+low-carbon+energy+supply+chains.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dbbd0d8d7-f360-49cc-9d5a-cb9a9297b497%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A27%3A41%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-30T13%3A27%3A42%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46894%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EAamal+Q.P.S.C.%E2%80%99s+Legend+Trading+and+Distribution+Signs+Agreement+to+Distribute+Marshal+Tyres+in+Qatar%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAamal+Company+Q.P.S.C.%2C+one+of+the+region%E2%80%99s+leading+diversified+companies%2C+announced+that+its+subsidiary%2C+Legend+Trading+and+Distribution%2C+has+signed+%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAamal+Company+Q.P.S.C.%2C+one+of+the+region%E2%80%99s+leading+diversified+companies%2C+announced+that+its+subsidiary%2C+Legend+Trading+and+Distribution%2C+has+signed+a+distribution+agreement+with+Kumho+Tire+Co.%2C+Ltd.+to+distribute+Marshal+tyres+in+Qatar.+The+agreement+supports+Legend%E2%80%99s+strategy+to+diversify+its+product+portfolio+and+offer+customers+a+wider+choice+of+high-quality+tyres.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D2183d981-ee51-4f72-8173-78091b5b175e%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-30T07%3A43%3A07%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-30T07%3A43%3A07%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46892%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EDukhan+Bank%3A+To+disclose+its+Quarter+3+financial+results+on+07%2F10%2F2026%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EDukhan+Bank+discloses+its+financial+statement+for+the+period+ending+30th+September+2026+on+07%2F10%2F2026.%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDukhan+Bank+discloses+its+financial+statement+for+the+period+ending+30th+September+2026+on+07%2F10%2F2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-30T07%3A42%3A39%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInfor