++++++++++%3CSummary%3E27+September+2026++++++++++Ooredoo+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+Ooredoo+International+Finance+Limited+%28OIFL%29%2C+its+wholly-owned+subsidiary%2C+pursuant+to+the%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3B27+September+2026++++++++++%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOoredoo+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+Ooredoo+International+Finance+Limited+%28OIFL%29%2C+its+wholly-owned+subsidiary%2C+pursuant+to+the+Terms+and+Conditions+of+the+Notes+and+the+Final+Terms%2C+will+pay+its+Global+Medium+Term+Note+%28GMTN%29+holders%E2%80%99+interest+payment+on+08+%26amp%3B+13+October+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BBelow+is+the+announcement+in+full%3A%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B-------------------------------------------------------------------------%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BU.S.+%241%2C000%2C000%2C000+%40+2.625+per+cent.+Guaranteed+Notes+due+08+April+2031%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B%28ISIN+Code%3A+144+A-+US74735KAA07%2C+Reg+S+%E2%80%93+XS2311299957%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B%28the+%22Notes%22%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BIssued+by+Ooredoo+International+Finance+Limited+%28the+%22Issuer%22%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BThe+Issuer+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+Ooredoo+Q.P.S.C+hereby+gives+notice+that+pursuant+to+the+Terms+and+Conditions+of+the+Notes+and+the+Final+Terms%2C+it+will+pay+Noteholders+U.S.+13%2C125%2C000.00+on+the+Interest+Payment+Date+falling+due+on+08+October+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B-------------------------------------------------------------------------%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BU.S.+%24500%2C000%2C000+%40+4.625+per+cent.+Guaranteed+Notes+due+10+October+2034%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B%28ISIN+Code%3A+144+A-+US68341PAB58%2C+Reg+S+%E2%80%93+XS2910502637%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B%28the+%22Notes%22%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BIssued+by+Ooredoo+International+Finance+Limited+%28the+%22Issuer%22%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3BThe+Issuer+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+Ooredoo+Q.P.S.C+hereby+gives+notice+that+pursuant+to+the+Terms+and+Conditions+of+the+Notes+and+the+Final+Terms%2C+it+will+pay+Noteholders+U.S.+11%2C562%2C500.00+on+the+Interest+Payment+Date+falling+due+on+13+October+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+center%3B%22%26gt%3B-------------------------------------------------------------------------%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BTerms+defined+in+this+Notice+shall+have+the+meaning+given+to+them+in+the+Terms+and+Conditions+of+the+Notes+and+the+Final+Terms.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+Notice+is+given+by+Ooredoo+International+Finance+Limited.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D26d52128-180f-49a4-99a2-8edfa21fc953%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-28T07%3A32%3A44%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-28T07%3A32%3A45%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46880%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+Announces+Results+of+the+Meeting+and+Expected+Acceptance+of+Exchange+Instructions%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3ENOT+FOR+RELEASE%2C+PUBLICATION+OR+DISTRIBUTION%2C+IN+WHOLE+OR+IN+PART%2C+IN+OR+INTO+OR+TO+ANY+PERSON+LOCATED+OR+RESIDENT+IN+THE+UNITED+STATES%2C+ITS+TERRITORI%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BNOT+FOR+RELEASE%2C+PUBLICATION+OR+DISTRIBUTION%2C+IN+WHOLE+OR+IN+PART%2C+IN+OR+INTO+OR+TO+ANY+PERSON+LOCATED+OR+RESIDENT+IN+THE+UNITED+STATES%2C+ITS+TERRITORIES+AND+POSSESSIONS+%28INCLUDING+PUERTO+RICO%2C+THE+U.S.+VIRGIN+ISLANDS%2C+GUAM%2C+AMERICAN+SAMOA%2C+WAKE+ISLAND+AND+THE+NORTHERN+MARIANA+ISLANDS%29%2C+ANY+STATE+OF+THE+UNITED+STATES+OR+THE+DISTRICT+OF+COLUMBIA+%28THE+%E2%80%9CUNITED+STATES%E2%80%9D%29+OR+TO+ANY+U.S.+PERSON+OR+IN+OR+INTO+ANY+OTHER+JURISDICTION+WHERE+IT+IS+UNLAWFUL+TO+DISTRIBUTE+THIS+ANNOUNCEMENT.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDoha%2C+24+September+2026%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BFurther+to+Estithmar%E2%80%99s+announcements+dated+2+September+2026+and+14+September+2026+%28together%2C+the+%E2%80%9CPrevious+Announcements%E2%80%9D%29%2C+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+%28%22Estithmar%22%29+announces+the+results+of+the+meeting+of+Certificateholders+and+the+expected+acceptance+of+Exchange+Instructions+in+respect+of+the+exchange+offer+and+consent+solicitation+in+relation+to+the+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027+%28ISIN%3A+XS2884005047%29+issued+by+Estithmar+Sukuk+Limited+LLC+%28the+%22Trustee%22%29+%28the+%22Existing+Certificates%22%29.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BResults+of+the+Meeting%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+hereby+announces+that+of+the+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+in+aggregate+face+amount+of+Existing+Certificates+outstanding%2C+Certificateholders+representing+QAR+881%2C300%2C000+in+aggregate+face+amount%2C+being+97.92+per+cent.+of+the+Existing+Certificates+outstanding%2C+were+present+or+represented+at+the+Meeting+held+at+12%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+24+September+2026%2C+such+that+the+quorum+requirement+of+not+less+than+75+per+cent.+of+the+aggregate+face+amount+of+the+Existing+Certificates+outstanding+was+satisfied.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQAR+721%2C350%2C000+in+aggregate+face+amount+voted+in+favour+of+the+Extraordinary+Resolution.+Accordingly%2C+of+the+votes+cast+in+respect+of+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+at+the+Meeting%2C+being+votes+in+favour+of+and+against+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+and+excluding+any+abstentions%2C+86.71+per+cent.+voted+in+favour+of+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+thus+exceeding+the+required+majority+of+three-quarters+of+the+votes+cast.+The+Extraordinary+Resolution+was+therefore+duly+passed.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BExpected+Acceptance+of+Exchange+Instructions%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+expects+to+accept+for+exchange+Existing+Certificates+validly+offered+for+exchange+pursuant+to+the+Exchange+Offer+in+an+aggregate+face+amount+of+QAR+527%2C960%2C000.+The+new+sukuk+issue+will+be+for+a+total+amount+comprising+of+this+exchange+amount+and+any+additional+cash+subscription+amount+and+it+is+expected+to+settle+on+or+around+29+September+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOffer+and+Distribution+Restrictions%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+offer+and+distribution+restrictions+set+out+in+the+Previous+Announcements+and+the+Offer+Memorandum+continue+to+apply+to+this+announcement+as+if+set+out+in+full.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+announcement+has+been+authorised+for+release+by+Mr.+Ramez+MHD+Ruslan+Alkhayyat%2C+Vice+Chairman+of+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3De269217e-2284-45d7-b72d-0db58adc9065%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-24T15%3A52%3A41%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-24T15%3A52%3A42%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46876%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EMEEZA+Awards+Construction+Contract+for+New+Data+Center+to+Elegancia+for+more+than+QAR+500+million%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EMEEZA+QSTP+LLC+announces+that+it+has+awarded+the+construction+contract+for+its+new+Data+Center+to+Elegancia+Contracting+and+Industries+for+more+than+Q%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BMEEZA+QSTP+LLC+announces+that+it+has+awarded+the+construction+contract+for+its+new+Data+Center+to+Elegancia+Contracting+and+Industries+for+more+than+QAR+500+million.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+new+facility+is+part+of+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+expansion+pipeline+to+support+growing+demand+from+Cloud+Computing+Artificial+Intelligence%2C+Cybersecurity%2C+and+Digital+Transformation+applications.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-24T08%3A18%3A12%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-24T08%3A18%3A12%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46874%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3E+Qatar+Insurance+%28QIC%29+strengthens+its+partnership+with+ASR+to+expand+across+Africa+and+developing+markets%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Insurance+%28QIC%29%2C+the+leading+insurer+in+Qatar+and+one+of+the+largest+across+the+Middle+East+and+North+Africa+%28MENA%29%2C+today+announced+the+strengt%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Insurance+%28QIC%29%2C+the+leading+insurer+in+Qatar+and+one+of+the+largest+across+the+Middle+East+and+North+Africa+%28MENA%29%2C+today+announced+the+strengthening+of+its+partnership+by+investing+in+Africa+Specialty+Risks+%28ASR%29%2C+the+Africa+%26amp%3B+developing+markets+focused+specialist+%28re%29insurance+group.%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BThe+investment+builds+upon+a+successful+partnership+between+QIC+and+ASR%2C+during+which+QIC+has+been+a+reinsurance+capacity+provider+across+ASR%E2%80%99s+portfolio%2C+providing+Funds+at+Lloyd%E2%80%99s+%28FAL%29+to+ASR+Syndicate+2454+and+binder+capacity+through+Antares.+This+partnership+has+allowed+QIC+to+diversify+its+geographic+exposure%2C+accessing+ASR%E2%80%99s+unique+Africa+%26amp%3B+developing+markets+focused+underwriting.%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BFounded+in+2020+and+led+by+Mikir+Shah%2C+ASR+has+established+itself+as+one+of+the+leading+specialty+%28re%29insurance+groups+focused+on+Africa+and+developing+markets.+The+group%E2%80%99s+unique+platform+provides+local+underwriting+expertise+and+access+to+A+rated+global+capacity+from+ASR%E2%80%99s+own+Syndicate+and+reinsurer+alongside+its+partners.%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BLeadership+commentary%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BSalem+Al+Mannai%2C+Group+Chief+Executive+Officer+of+QIC%2C+said%3A+%E2%80%9CThis+investment+takes+QIC+into+markets+where+few+insurers+from+our+region+have+a+presence%2C+and+it+adds+a+further+source+of+diversified+growth+to+a+Group+that+continues+to+expand+its+international+reach.+Our+decision+to+invest+and+deepen+our+relationship+with+Africa+Specialty+Risks+reflects+our+confidence+in+both+the+long-term+growth+prospects+of+African+and+developing+insurance+markets+and+the+exceptional+quality+of+the+ASR+platform.+Over+the+past+two+years%2C+we+have+worked+closely+with+the+ASR+team+and+have+been+consistently+impressed+by+their+underwriting+expertise%2C+market+knowledge+and+execution+capabilities.+This+partnership+provides+QIC+with+a+highly+effective+platform+to+participate+in+the+growth+journey+of+Africa+and+other+developing+markets+alongside+a+proven+management+team+and+a+world-class+insurance+partner.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BMikir+Shah%2C+CEO%2C+Africa+Specialty+Risks%2C+commented%3A+%E2%80%9CWorking+with+QIC+over+the+last+few+years%2C+we%E2%80%99ve+built+a+strong+partnership+as+they%E2%80%99ve+looked+to+access+our+African+and+developing+market+focused+specialty+underwriting+while+supporting+us+with+capacity.+ASR+was+built+to+enable+sustainable+economic+development+in+growth+economies+by+fulfilling+unmet+insurance+needs%2C+and+I+look+forward+to+continuing+to+realise+this+mission+while+working+closely+with+our+key+partners.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BStrategic+rationale%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BThe+investment+advances+QIC%E2%80%99s+international+growth+strategy+of+partnering+with+specialist+underwriting+businesses+and+proven+management+teams+in+markets+with+strong+long-term+growth.+It+extends+QIC%E2%80%99s+reach+beyond+its+established+platforms+in+Qatar+and+the+GCC%2C+at+Lloyd%E2%80%99s+and+in+international+reinsurance+and+Asia%2C+into+Africa+and+developing+markets%2C+where+insurance+penetration+remains+low+and+demand+for+specialty+cover+is+rising+with+the+real+economy.+Few+insurers+headquartered+in+the+region+have+built+a+position+in+these+markets.%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BThrough+ASR%E2%80%99s+regional+network%2C+specialist+underwriting+expertise+and+local+market+knowledge%2C+QIC+gains+a+further+source+of+diversified+premium+and+earnings+growth+alongside+a+management+team+it+has+already+worked+with+as+a+capacity+partner.+The+investment+is+consistent+with+the+QIC%E2%80%99s+continued+expansion+of+its+international+portfolio+and+its+objective+of+building+a+more+diversified%2C+higher-return+business+for+shareholders.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Deb46c3f0-9c54-4f1b-a9ca-279885134ba0%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-24T08%3A06%3A02%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-24T08%3A06%3A03%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46872%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EOoredoo+Group+and+Zain+Group+Receive+Kuwait+Competition+Protection+Authority+Approval+for+Tower+Joint+Venture%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EDoha%2C+Qatar%2C+23+September+2026%3A+Ooredoo+Q.P.S.C.+%28%E2%80%9COoredoo%E2%80%9D%29+%E2%80%93+Ticker+ORDS+%E2%80%93+has+announced+that+Ooredoo+Group+and+Zain+Group+have+received+approval+fr%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BDoha%2C+Qatar%2C+23+September+2026%3A+Ooredoo+Q.P.S.C.+%28%E2%80%9COoredoo%E2%80%9D%29+%E2%80%93+Ticker+ORDS+%E2%80%93%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B+has+announced+that+Ooredoo+Group+and+Zain+Group+have+received+approval+from+the+Kuwait+Competition+Protection+Authority+for+the+economic+concentration+relating+to+their+tower+joint+venture.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+approval+follows+the+definitive+agreements+announced+on+5+December+2023+to+establish+an+equally+owned+and+jointly+controlled+tower+platform+across+a+number+of+markets.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+approval+represents+an+important+milestone+in+the+phased+implementation+of+the+transaction.+Completion+of+the+transaction+remains+subject+to+the+satisfaction+of+the+remaining+closing+conditions+set+out+in+the+transaction+documents+and+the+receipt+of+all+relevant+internal+and+regulatory+approvals.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOoredoo+Group+and+Zain+Group+will+continue+to+work+closely+with+the+relevant+authorities+to+complete+the+required+procedures%2C+secure+the+outstanding+approvals+and+fulfil+the+applicable+disclosure+requirements.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+financial+impact+cannot+be+determined+at+this+stage.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D571ec149-bcfc-453f-b4ff-f855fb343244%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-24T07%3A49%3A57%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-24T07%3A49%3A57%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3C