mationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-21T08%3A05%3A08%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46860%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EAhlibank+QPSC+announces+its+update+to+the+base+prospectus+for+the+medium-term+bond+issuance+program+valued+at+2+billion+US+dollars%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAhlibank+QPSC+%28the+%E2%80%9CBank%E2%80%9D%29+announces+the+completion+of+its+update+of+the+base+prospectus+for+the+medium-term+notes+programme+of+2+billion+US+Dollars+%28%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAhlibank+QPSC+%28the+%E2%80%9CBank%E2%80%9D%29+announces+the+completion+of+its+update+of+the+base+prospectus+for+the+medium-term+notes+programme+of+2+billion+US+Dollars+%28the+%E2%80%9CProgramme%E2%80%9D%29%2C+guaranteed+by+the+Bank%2C+and+issued+by+ABQ+Finance+SPC+LLC+%E2%80%93+QFC+License+05527+%28As+per+CR+attached%29+%28the+%E2%80%9CIssuer%E2%80%9D%29%2C+a+special+purpose+company+wholly+owned+by+the+Bank.+%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BAccordingly%2C+Barclays+Bank+PLC%2C+QNB+Capital+LLC%2C+Deutsche+Bank+AG%2C+Goldman+Sachs%2C+J.P.+Morgan+PLC%2C+Mizuho+international+PLC%2C+and+Standard+Chartered+Bank+have+been+appointed+as+joint+lead+managers+for+the+proposed+issuance+under+the+Programme.+This+may+be+followed%2C+starting+from+21%2F09%2F2026%2C+by+the+issuance+of+fixed-rate+US+dollar+notes+for+a+period+of+five+years+under+Regulation+S%2C+subject+to+market+conditions.%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3BThe+stabilization+provisions+of+the+International+Capital+Market+Association+and+the+Financial+Conduct+Authority+apply%2C+noting+that+the+target+market+for+the+Issuer+%28MIFID+II+product+governance%29+is+limited+to+eligible+counterparties+and+professional+clients+only+%28all+distribution+channels%29.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+prospectus+can+be+viwed+via+the+link+%3A+https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ahlibank.com.qa%2Fen%2Fabout-us%2Finvestor-relations%2Femtn+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dc0c0ecb6-737e-4797-9eb0-5f9a349325c6%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-20T13%3A58%3A16%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-20T13%3A58%3A16%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46857%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EDoha+Insurance+Group+obtains+an+approval+by+the+Qatar+Central+Bank+to+convert+Doha+Islamic+Insurance+Company+-+Shamel+-+into+a+Private+Joint+Stock+Company%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EDoha+Insurance+Group%2C+Q.P.S.C.+discloses+that+it+has+obtained+the+Qatar+Central+Bank%E2%80%99s+no-objection+to+the+conversion+of+Doha+Islamic+Insurance+Compan%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDoha+Insurance+Group%2C+Q.P.S.C.+discloses+that+it+has+obtained+the+Qatar+Central+Bank%E2%80%99s+no-objection+to+the+conversion+of+Doha+Islamic+Insurance+Company+%E2%80%93+Shamel%2C+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+the+Group%2C+into+a+Private+Joint+Stock+Company%2C+in+preparation+for+commencing+the+procedures+to+convert+it+into+a+public+shareholding+company+within+a+period+of+two+years.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-17T23%3A11%3A19%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-17T23%3A11%3A19%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46853%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+Announces+Completion+of+48.68%25+Stake+Transfer+in+Shahba+Bank+to+Masaref+Holding%2C+a+Subsidiary+of+Estithmar+Capital%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%2C+listed+on+the+Qatar+Stock+Exchange+with+a+market+capitalization+of+approximately+USD+5+Bn%2C+announced+the+completion+of+the%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%2C+listed+on+the+Qatar+Stock+Exchange+with+a+market+capitalization+of+approximately+USD+5+Bn%2C+announced+the+completion+of+the+transfer+of+a+48.68%25+stake+in+the+share+capital+of+Shahba+Bank+to+Masaref+Holding+LLC%2C+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+Estithmar+Capital%2C+Estithmar+Holding%E2%80%99s+financial+services+and+investments+arm.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+stake+was+transferred+from+Banque+Bemo+Saudi+Fransi+and+Ahli+Trust+Bank+following+the+fulfilment+of+the+required+conditions+and+receipt+of+the+relevant+regulatory+approvals%2C+marking+the+formal+completion+of+the+transaction+and+moving+it+from+agreement+to+execution.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+transaction+marks+a+strategic+milestone+in+Estithmar+Holding%E2%80%99s+expansion+in+the+financial+services+sector+across+the+region%2C+reflecting+the+Group%E2%80%99s+long-term+investment+vision+and+confidence+in+Syria%E2%80%99s+economic+potential%2C+as+well+as+its+commitment+to+supporting+the+development+of+the+banking+sector+and+strengthening+its+capacity+to+serve+the+national+economy.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D207b73e3-7704-44dc-ab30-a9fc558fa28a%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-17T19%3A38%3A56%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-17T19%3A38%3A57%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46851%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Fuel+Co.%3A+The+EGM+Endorses+Items+on+Its+Agenda+%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Fuel+Co.+announces+the+results+of+the+EGM.+The+meeting+was+held+on+17%2F09%2F2026+and+the+following+resolution+were+approved%26%23xD%3B1.+The+amendment+of+th%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Fuel+Co.+announces+the+results+of+the+EGM.+The+meeting+was+held+on+17%2F09%2F2026+and+the+following+resolution+were+approved%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B1.+The+amendment+of+the+Articles+of+Association+as+presented+to+