6gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BBoard+Member+Shareholding+Requirements%3A+1%2C200%2C000+share.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr+%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D6fb87f8d-6c16-47dd-9e2a-d99a4fbc9747%22%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-16T07%3A30%3A00%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-16T10%3A58%3A25%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46836%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EEstithmar+Holding+QPSC+Announces+Update+in+Respect+of+its+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3ENOT+FOR+RELEASE%2C+PUBLICATION+OR+DISTRIBUTION%2C+IN+WHOLE+OR+IN+PART%2C+IN+OR+INTO+OR+TO+ANY+PERSON+LOCATED+OR+RESIDENT+IN+THE+UNITED+STATES%2C+ITS+TERRITORI%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BNOT+FOR+RELEASE%2C+PUBLICATION+OR+DISTRIBUTION%2C+IN+WHOLE+OR+IN+PART%2C+IN+OR+INTO+OR+TO+ANY+PERSON+LOCATED+OR+RESIDENT+IN+THE+UNITED+STATES%2C+ITS+TERRITORIES+AND+POSSESSIONS+%28INCLUDING+PUERTO+RICO%2C+THE+U.S.+VIRGIN+ISLANDS%2C+GUAM%2C+AMERICAN+SAMOA%2C+WAKE+ISLAND+AND+THE+NORTHERN+MARIANA+ISLANDS%29%2C+ANY+STATE+OF+THE+UNITED+STATES+OR+THE+DISTRICT+OF+COLUMBIA+%28THE+%E2%80%9CUNITED+STATES%E2%80%9D%29+OR+TO+ANY+U.S.+PERSON+OR+IN+OR+INTO+ANY+OTHER+JURISDICTION+WHERE+IT+IS+UNLAWFUL+TO+DISTRIBUTE+THIS+ANNOUNCEMENT.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+%28%22Estithmar%22%29+announces%2C+further+to+the+announcement+dated+2+September+2026+%28the+%22Previous+Announcement%22%29%2C++an+update+in+respect+of+the+exchange+offer+and+consent+solicitation+in+relation+to+the+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027+%28ISIN%3A+XS2884005047%29+issued+by+Estithmar+Sukuk+Limited+LLC+%28the+%22Trustee%22%29+%28the+%22Existing+Certificates%22%29.+Capitalised+terms+used+but+not+otherwise+defined+in+this+announcement+shall+have+the+meanings+given+to+them+in+the+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+Memorandum+dated+2+September+2026+%28the+%22Offer+Memorandum%22%29.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+hereby+announces+that+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+will+be+considered+at+the+Meeting+of+Certificateholders+to+be+held+at+12%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+24+September+2026+at+the+offices+of+Simmons+%26amp%3B+Simmons+LLP%2C+CityPoint%2C+One+Ropemaker+Street%2C+London+EC2Y+9SS%2C+United+Kingdom.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Meeting+will+be+held+in+accordance+with+the+Offer+Memorandum+and+Certificateholders+will+be+invited+to+consider+and%2C+if+thought+fit%2C+pass+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+at+the+Meeting+%28or+any+adjourned+Meeting%29..+Exchange+Instructions+and+Voting+Instructions+will+be+irrevocable+except+in+the+limited+circumstances+described+in+the+Offer+Memorandum.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BCertificateholders+may+continue+to+submit+Exchange+Instructions+and+Voting+Instructions+until+4%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+21+September+2026+%28the+%22Final+Deadline%22%29+in+accordance+with+the+procedures+described+in+the+Offer+Memorandum.+Such+Instructions+will+be+treated+as+instructions+for+the+purpose+of+the+Meeting+on+24+September+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BSave+as+described+in+this+announcement%2C+the+terms+of+the+Invitation%2C+the+Exchange+Offer%2C+the+Consent+Solicitation+and+the+Proposal+remain+unchanged.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BFull+details+of+the+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation%2C+including+the+applicable+conditions+and+procedures+for+participation%2C+are+set+out+in+the+Offer+Memorandum%2C+which+is+available+to+eligible+holders+at+https%3A%2F%2Fdeals.is.kroll.com%2Festithmar+and+has+also+been+announced+via+the+Regulatory+News+Service+of+the+London+Stock+Exchange.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+offer+and+distribution+restrictions+set+out+in+the+Previous+Announcement+and+the+Offer+Memorandum+continue+to+apply+to+this+announcement+as+if+set+out+in+full.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+announcement+has+been+authorised+for+release+by+Mr.+Ramez+MHD+Ruslan+Alkhayyat%2C+Vice+Chairman+of+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Db2c74cab-efbe-46a4-966f-0cf8bd3d256d%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-14T08%3A49%3A54%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-14T08%3A49%3A54%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46834%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+Announces+Elegancia+Arabia+Trading+Secures+SAR+829+Million+Contract+for+Qiddiya%E2%80%99s+Prince+Mohammed+Bin+Salman+Stadium%2C+Set+to+Host+FIFA+World+Cup+2034.%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EElegancia+Arabia+Trading%2C+part+of+the+Contracting+and+Industries+%28C%26amp%3BI%29+operating+segment+of+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%2C+has+been+awarded+the+Mechanica%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BElegancia+Arabia+Trading%2C+part+of+the+Contracting+and+Industries+%28C%26amp%3BI%29+operating+segment+of+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%2C+has+been+awarded+the+Mechanical+Package+for+the+Prince+Mohammed+Bin+Salman+Stadium+in+Qiddiya+City%2C+Saudi+Arabia%2C+with+a+contract+value+of+SAR+829+million.+The+stadium+is+one+of+Saudi+Arabia%E2%80%99s+flagship+giga-projects+and+a+designated+venue+for+the+FIFA+World+Cup+2034%2C+reinforcing+Elegancia%E2%80%99s+growing+role+in+the+Kingdom%E2%80%99s+infrastructure+transformation.+The+award+marks+Elegancia+Electromechanical+Services+%E2%80%99s+largest+project+in+Saudi+Arabia%2C+reinforces+Estithmar+Holding%E2%80%99s+strategic+expansion+in+the+Kingdom.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Df7c40abb-0716-40d6-93df-14c46dab3a35%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-10T15%3A51%3A12%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-10T15%3A51%3A12%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46832%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Company+disclosure+of+a+lawsuit+%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Company+announces+that+M%2FS.+Technical+Aluminum+Company+has+filed+a+lawsuit+%28Case+No.+6213%2F2026%29+in+the+Investment+and+T%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Company+announces+that+M%2FS.+Technical+Aluminum+Company+has+filed+a+lawsuit+%28Case+No.+6213%2F2026%29+in+the+Investment+and+Trade+Court+against+it+%E2%80%93+in+its+capacity+as+the+second+defendant+-+and+others.+The+lawsuit+claims+the+sum+of+QAR+7%2C466%2C770.96+for+subcontracting+work+performed+by+the+plaintiff+for+the+first+defendant+under+an+agreement+between+them.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-09T14%3A06%3A57%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-09T14%3A06%3A58%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46831%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Co.+%3A+Discloses+the+judgment+in+the+lawsuit+no%3A+737+731%2F2026%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Co.+discloses+the+judgment+in+the+lawsuit+no+737+731+2026+.Qatar+Industrial+Manufacturing++Company+discloses+%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Co.+discloses+the+judgment+in+the+lawsuit+no+737+731+2026+.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Industrial+Manufacturing+Company+discloses+the+issuance+of+a+final+judgment+ordering+it+to+pay+M%2FS.+Qatari+Diar+Real+Estate+Investment+Company+the+sum+of+QAR+1%2C701%2C415+for+service+fees.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%A0%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-09T07%3A39%3A00%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-09T08%3A03%3A32%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46824%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company%3A+Transfer+of+Al+Meera%E2%80%99s+Shares+in+Baladna+to+Al+Meera%E2%80%99s+Investment+Portfolio%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+its+Board+of+Directors+issued+a+resolution+on+08+September+2026+to+transfer%2C+by+way+of+an+in-k%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+its+Board+of+Directors+issued+a+resolution+on+08+September+2026+to+transfer%2C+by+way+of+an+in-kind+transfer+%2885%2C759%2C398%29+shares+owned+by+Al+Meera+in+Baladna+Q.P.S.C.+to+Al+Meera%E2%80%99s+investment+portfolio+maintained+with+Al+Rayan+Investment+LLC%2C+in+consideration+for+the+allocation+of+investment+units+in+Al+Meera%E2%80%99s+name+equivalent+to+the+value+of+the+transferred+shares%2C+the+value+of+the+shares+and+the+corresponding+number+of+investment+units+will+be+determined+on+the+transaction+execution+date.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+decision+comes+as+part+of+the+restructuring+and+management+of+the+Company%E2%80%99s+investments%2C+with+a+view+to+enhancing+the+efficiency+and+flexibility+of+its+investment+portfolio+management.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+transfer+is+subject+to+completion+of+the+necessary+regulatory+approvals+and+procedures.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-08T13%3A59%3A56%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-08T13%3A59%3A57%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46822%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EMEEZA+Signs+One+of+the+Largest+Agreements+in+the+IT+Sector%2C+Worth+Over+QAR+1+Billion%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EMEEZA%2C+Qatar%E2%80%99s+leading+Data+Centre+and+Managed+IT+Services+provider%2C+today+announced+the+signing+of+a+landmark+agreement+with+a+global+hyperscaler%2C+on%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BMEEZA%2C+Qatar%E2%80%99s+leading+Data+Centre+and+Managed+IT+Services+provider%2C+today+announced+the+signing+of+a+landmark+agreement+with+a+global+hyperscaler%2C+one+of+the+world%E2%80%99s+fastest-growing+Cloud+Service+providers%2C+in+a+deal+valued+at+more+than+QAR+1+billion.+The+agreement+represents+the+largest+contract+in+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+history+and+will+provide+operational+capacity+of+8+megawatts+of+Data+Centre+services+under+a+long-term+leasing+agreement.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+agreement+marks+a+significant+milestone+for+MEEZA+and+Qatar%E2%80%99s+Digital+Infrastructure+ecosystem%2C+reflecting+the+growing+demand+for+world-class+Data+Centre+capacity+driven+by+the+rapid+expansion+of+Cloud+Computing%2C+Artificial+Intelligence%2C+and+Data-intensive+technologies.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BImportantly%2C+the+capacity+underscores+the+strong+demand+for+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+Data+Centre+infrastructure+and+the+global+hyperscaler%E2%80%99s+confidence+in+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+ability+to+deliver+highly+resilient%2C+secure%2C+and+efficient+Digital+Infrastructure.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+new+Data+Centre+campus+will+support+the+Hyperscaler%E2%80%99s+growing+Cloud+and+AI+workloads%2C+providing+the+highest+levels+of+reliability%2C+efficiency%2C+and+scalability+while+contributing+to+Qatar%E2%80%99s+ambitions+to+establish+itself+as+a+leading+regional+hub+for+digital+infrastructure+and+attract+global+technology+investments.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOn+this+occasion%2C+Mr.+Mohammed+Ali+Al-Ghaithani%2C+Chief+Executive+Officer+of+MEEZA%2C+stated%3A%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%E2%80%9CThis+landmark+agreement%2C+the+largest+in+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+history%2C+is+a+powerful+testament+to+the+growing+demand+for+our+Data+Centre+infrastructure+and+the+confidence+that+global+technology+leaders+place+in+MEEZA.+Securing+this+commitment+reflects+the+strength+of+the+market+opportunity+and+the+importance+of+scalable+digital+infrastructure.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAs+outlined+in+our+previous+released+statements%2C+we+are+on+track+to+quadruple+our+current+Data+Centre+capacity.+This+expansion+will+support+Qatar+National+Vision+2030+and+the+Qatar+Digital+Agenda+2030%2C+while+enabling+us+to+meet+the+rapidly+growing+demand+for+cloud+and+AI+infrastructure.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOur+collaboration+with+one+of+the+world%E2%80%99s+fastest-growing+Cloud+Service+providers+further+reinforces+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+pivotal+role+in+accelerating+Qatar%E2%80%99s+digital+transformation+and+strengthening+its+position+as+a+trusted+destination+for+global+investments%2C+cloud+computing%2C+artificial+intelligence%2C+and+advanced+technology+infrastructure.+We+are+proud+to+support+the+next+phase+of+digital+growth+in+Qatar+and+look+forward+to+delivering+infrastructure+that+meets+the+highest+international+standards.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BBy+combining+MEEZA%E2%80%99s+deep+local+expertise+and+operational+capabilities+with+the+global+reach+of+a+leading+hyperscaler%2C+the+agreement+represents+a+major+step+forward+in+the+development+of+Qatar%E2%80%99s+digital+infrastructure+landscape.+MEEZA+continues+to+set+new+benchmarks+in+the+design%2C+operation%2C+and+management+of+Data+Centres%2C+delivering+secure%2C+resilient%2C+and+scalable+infrastructure+designed+to+meet+the+highest+international+standards.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D066b0712-b8ba-4b0c-8f54-5d135c664e09%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-08T08%3A09%3A32%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-08T08%3A09%3A32%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46818%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EThe+Commercial+Bank+%28P.S.Q.C.%29+Announces+Cancellation+of+Share+Buyback%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EDoha%2C+07+September+2026%2CFurther+to+The+Commercial+Bank+%28P.S.Q.C.%29%E2%80%99s+Share+Buyback+plan+previously+announced+on+22+May+2025%2C+the+