+scheme+for+employees+%28%E2%80%9C%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BLTIS%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%E2%80%9D%29+and+all+arrangements+ancillary+to+the+LTIS.+As+part+of+the+winding+up+process%2C+the+Bank+purchased+%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3B192%2C765%2C183%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B+of+the+Bank%E2%80%99s+shares+at+%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BQAR+4.0689%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%2C+being+the+prevailing+market+price%2C+as+part+of+an+exempt+transaction+under+the+Qatar+Central+Securities+Depository+%28%E2%80%9C%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BEDAA%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%E2%80%9D%29+Rules+and+Procedure+Guide+%28%E2%80%9C%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BExempt+Transaction%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%E2%80%9D%29.+The+Bank+funded+the+Exempt+Transaction+from+its+own+internal+funding+sources.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+shares+acquired+pursuant+to+the+Exempt+Transaction+shall+be+held+by+the+Bank+as+treasury+shares+in+accordance+with+the+applicable+laws%2C+regulations+and+regulatory+approvals.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Exempt+Transaction+was+executed+after+obtaining+the+necessary+regulatory+approvals+including+that+of+the+Qatar+Central+Bank%2C+the+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+and+EDAA.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dcdbbacc2-9465-426a-9306-5f99a834b1f2%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-07T14%3A25%3A06%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-07T14%3A25%3A06%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46812%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EWidam+Food+Company%3A+Launches+Camel+Slaughterhouse+and+Mobile+Slaughterhouse+in+Abu+Nakhla%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EWidam+Food+Company+Q.P.S.C.%2C+the+leading+company+in+the+meat+%2C+livestock+sector+%2C+the+principal+operator+of+Al+Wakra+Central+Slaughterhouse+and+privat%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BWidam+Food+Company+Q.P.S.C.%2C+the+leading+company+in+the+meat+%2C+livestock+sector+%2C+the+principal+operator+of+Al+Wakra+Central+Slaughterhouse+and+private+Slaughterhouses+across+the+State+of+Qatar%2C+has+officially+launched+both+the+Camel+Slaughterhouse++at+Abu+Nakhla+Camel+Market+and+a+mobile+Slaughterhouse+located+at+the+company%E2%80%99s+sheep+sales+yard+in+the+Abu+Nakhla+area.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+launch+forms+part+of+the+company%E2%80%99s+expansion+strategy+and+its+ongoing+efforts+to+enhance+the+quality+of+its+services+and+products+in+line+with+consumers%E2%80%99+needs+and+expectations.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+opening+of+the+Camel+slaughterhouse+%2C+a+specialized+facility+dedicated+to+the+slaughtering+and+processing+of+camel+meat%2C+represents+an+important+step+toward+strengthening+food+security+and+supporting+self-sufficiency+in+Qatar%E2%80%99s+camel+meat+sector.+In+addition+to+providing+services+to+the+local+community%2C+the+facility+will+serve+the+commercial+sector%2C+which+meets+the+daily+demand+of+the+local+market+for+fresh+camel+meat%E2%80%94a+segment+that+has+experienced+significant+growth+in+recent+years.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BMr.+Ayed+Al-Qahtani%2C+Chief+Executive+Officer+of+Widam+Food+Company%2C+said%3A%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%E2%80%9CWe+have+been+keen+to+establish+and+equip+both+facilities+in+accordance+with+the+highest+standards+of+hygiene%2C+food+safety%2C+and+operational+efficiency.+This+will+enable+us+to+meet+the+needs+of+both+the+local+community+and+the+commercial+sector%2C+while+accelerating+slaughtering+operations+and+fulfilling+daily+orders.+The+Camel+slaughterhouse+has+a+daily+production+capacity+exceeding+100+heads+of+camels%2C+while+the+mobile+slaughterhouse+has+a+daily+capacity+of+200+sheep.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BWidam+Food+Company+is+the+primary+supplier+of+livestock+as+well+as+chilled+and+frozen+meat+to+the+local+market.+The+company+also+manages+and+operates+the+automated+slaughterhouse+at+Al+Wakra+Central+Market%2C+in+addition+to+operating+a+number+of+other+private+slaughterhouse+across+the+country.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BWidam+also+owns+a+number+of+butcher+shops+located+throughout+Qatar%2C+as+well+as+a+Mobile+APP+offering+a+wide+range+of+high-quality+fresh%2C+chilled%2C+and+frozen+red+meats%2C+including+sheep%2C+beef%2C+and+camel+meat%2C+alongside+a+variety+of+other+food+products+at+competitive+prices.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThese+products+are+supported+by+a+home-delivery+service+operated+through+a+large+fleet+of+refrigerated+vehicles+equipped+with+a+GPS-based+monitoring+system%2C+ensuring+that+products+reach+customers+safely+and+maintain+the+highest+standards+of+quality+throughout+the+delivery+process.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-03T08%3A47%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-03T08%3A47%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46810%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQIB+Advances+to+%E2%80%98A%E2%80%99+in+MSCI+ESG+Rating%2C+Reinforcing+Its+Sustainability+Leadership%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Islamic+Bank+%28QIB%29%2C+Qatar%E2%80%99s+leading+bank%2C+has+achieved+an+upgrade+in+its+MSCI+ESG+Rating+from+BBB+to+A%2C+as+of+August+2026%2C+marking+the+fourth+co%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BQatar+Islamic+Bank+%28QIB%29%2C+Qatar%E2%80%99s+leading+bank%2C+has+achieved+an+upgrade+in+its+MSCI+ESG+Rating+from+BBB+to+A%2C+as+of+August+2026%2C+marking+the+fourth+consecutive+year+of+improvement+in+the+Bank%E2%80%99s+ESG+rating+levels.+With+this+latest+assessment%2C+QIB+is+one+of+the+highest+rated+organizations+in+Qatar%2C+reflecting+the+Bank%E2%80%99s+sustained+commitment+to+advancing+its+environmental%2C+social+and+governance+%28ESG%29+practices.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BQIB%E2%80%99s+rating+has+advanced+steadily+to+A+over+the+past+years%2C+driven+by+the+bank%E2%80%99s+strategic+priority+of+adopting+global+best+practices+in+Corporate+Sustainability.+This+consistent+progress+reflects+QIB%E2%80%99s+strategic+investment+across+multiple+fronts+%E2%80%94+strengthening+governance+structures+at+Board+and+management+level%2C+embedding+ESG+considerations+into+risk+management+and+product+development%2C+adopting+new+data+and+monitoring+capabilities%2C+and+enhancing+the+depth%2C+quality+and+transparency+of+its+sustainability+disclosures.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BQIB+has+driven+these+advancements+over+the+past+years+through+close+collaboration+across+all+departments%2C+embedding+sustainability+considerations+into+the+Bank%E2%80%99s+strategy%2C+governance%2C+risk+management%2C+product+development+and+day-to-day+operations.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BThe+latest+assessment+recorded+considerable+improvement+in+QIB%E2%80%99s+Industry+Adjusted+Score+for+the+banking+sector%2C+demonstrating+tangible+developments+in+the+way+ESG+considerations+are+integrated+and+managed+across+the+Bank%2C+among+peers.+The+Environmental+Pillar+showed+the+most+significant+improvement%2C+supported+by+stronger+ESG+integration+into+sustainability-related+financial+product+development%2C+enhanced+ESG+due-diligence+triggers+and+risk+escalation+processes%2C+and+closer+involvement+of+Credit+Risk+in+the+bank%E2%80%99s+ESG+Risk+Management.+QIB+also+recorded+considerable+improvement+in+the+Social+Pillar%2C+driven+by+progress+across+aspects+of+Human+Capital+Development%2C+Privacy+%26amp%3B+Data+Security%2C+Consumer+Financial+Protection+and+Access+to+Finance.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BCommenting+on+the+rating+upgrade%2C+Mr.+Bassel+Gamal%2C+QIB%27s+Group+CEO%2C+said%3A+%E2%80%9CWe+are+pleased+to+achieve+an+%E2%80%98A%E2%80%99+Rating+in+MSCI%E2%80%99s+assessment%2C+reflecting+our+continued+efforts+to+further+embed+responsible+practices+across+the+Bank.+This+milestone+encourages+us+to+build+on+our+progress%2C+further+advance+our+ESG+practices+and+continue+creating+long-term+value+for+our+employees%2C+customers%2C+shareholders+and+the+local+community.%E2%80%9D%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BMSCI+ESG+Ratings+measure+a+company%E2%80%99s+resilience+to+long-term%2C+industry-specific+sustainability+risks%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3Busing+a+rules-based+methodology.+MSCI+Sustainability+and+Climate+measures%2C+benchmarks+and+monitors%2C+sustainability+and+climate+performance+versus+peers+across+10%2C000+%2B+corporate+issuers%2C+collecting+thousands+of+data+points+for+each+company.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BThis+upgrade+strengthens+QIB%E2%80%99s+credibility+with+a+growing+base+of+international+and+regional+ESG-focused+investors%2C+many+of+whom+incorporate+MSCI+ESG+Ratings+directly+into+their+screening%2C+portfolio+construction+and+engagement+processes.+The+result+reinforces+QIB%E2%80%99s+alignment+with+Qatar+Central+Bank%E2%80%99s+Sustainability+Reporting+Framework+and+the+sustainability+priorities+of+Qatar+National+Vision+2030.+Ultimately%2C+the+rating+signals+to+shareholders%2C+regulators+and+customers+that+QIB+manages+ESG+considerations+not+only+as+a+compliance+obligation%2C+but+as+a+core+driver+of+long-term+resilience+and+value+creation.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3BFor+more+information%2C+please+visit+www.qib.com.qa.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D5ef31a0f-b01d-4556-bae0-889c5184ea2e%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-03T07%3A46%3A34%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-03T07%3A46%3A34%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46808%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+Announces+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+in+Relation+to+its+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EEstithmar+Holding+Announces+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+in+Relation+to+its+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027++NOT+FOR%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+Holding+Announces+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+in+Relation+to+its+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027++%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BNOT+FOR+RELEASE%2C+PUBLICATION+OR+DISTRIBUTION%2C+IN+WHOLE+OR+IN+PART%2C+IN+OR+INTO+OR+TO+ANY+PERSON+LOCATED+OR+RESIDENT+IN+THE+UNITED+STATES%2C+ITS+TERRITORIES+AND+POSSESSIONS+%28INCLUDING+PUERTO+RICO%2C+THE+U.S.+VIRGIN+ISLANDS%2C+GUAM%2C+AMERICAN+SAMOA%2C+WAKE+ISLAND+AND+THE+NORTHERN+MARIANA+ISLANDS%29%2C+ANY+STATE+OF+THE+UNITED+STATES+OR+THE+DISTRICT+OF+COLUMBIA+%28THE+%E2%80%9CUNITED+STATES%E2%80%9D%29+OR+TO+ANY+U.S.+PERSON+OR+IN+OR+INTO+ANY+OTHER+JURISDICTION+WHERE+IT+IS+UNLAWFUL+TO+DISTRIBUTE+THIS+ANNOUNCEMENT.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BDoha%2C+2+September+2026%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.+%28%22Estithmar%22%29+announces+that+Estithmar+Sukuk+Limited+LLC+%28the+%22Trustee%22%29%2C+a+special+purpose+company+established+for+the+purposes+of+the+Programme+%28as+defined+below%29+as+issuer+and+trustee+for+the+Certificateholders%2C+has+today+launched+an+invitation+to+Certificateholders+in+respect+of+the+Existing+Certificates+%28as+defined+below%29%2C+comprising%3A%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%28i%29+++++++++++++++Eligible+Certificateholders+to+offer+their+Existing+Certificates+for+exchange+for+new+Qatari+Riyal+denominated+Certificates+due+2029+%28the+%22New+Certificates%22%29+to+be+issued+by+the+Trustee+under+its+QAR+3%2C400%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificate+Issuance+Programme+%28the+%22Programme%22%29%2C+as+updated%2C+subject+to+the+satisfaction+or+waiver+of+the+conditions+described+in+the+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation+Memorandum+dated+2+September+2026+%28the+%22Offer+Memorandum%22%29+%28the+%22Exchange+Offer%22%29%3B+and+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%28ii%29+++++++++++++all+Certificateholders+to+consent+to+certain+modifications+to+the+terms+of+the+QAR+900%2C000%2C000+Trust+Certificates+due+September+2027+%28ISIN%3A+XS2884005047%29%2C+issued+under+the+Programme+and+listed+on+the+International+Securities+Market+of+the+London+Stock+Exchange+%28the+%22Existing+Certificates%22%29%2C+to+be+approved+by+Extraordinary+Resolution%2C+permitting+Estithmar+to+redeem+any+Existing+Certificates+that+remain+outstanding+following+completion+of+the+Exchange+Offer+%28the+%22Consent+Solicitation%22+and%2C+together+with+the+Exchange+Offer%2C+the+%22Invitation%22%29.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Consent+Solicitation+does+not+constitute+a+notice+of+redemption+of+the+Existing+Certificates%2C+and+no+redemption+of+any+Existing+Certificates+is+being+announced+by+Estithmar+pursuant+to+this+announcement.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+New+Certificates+will+be+issued+under+the+Programme%2C+as+updated%2C+in+an+aggregate+face+amount+of+up+to+QAR+1%2C000%2C000%2C000%2C+will+bear+a+profit+rate+of+9.00+per+cent.+per+annum%2C+payable+semi-annually+in+arrear%2C+and+will+have+a+scheduled+dissolution+date+falling+three+years+from+the+Issue+Date.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BNo+exchange%2C+issuance+of+New+Certificates+or+redemption+of+Existing+Certificates+has+occurred+as+at+the+date+of+this+announcement.+Completion+of+the+Exchange+Offer+and+implementation+of+the+proposed+modifications+remain+subject+to+the+applicable+conditions+and+procedures+described+in+the+Offer+Memorandum%2C+including+the+requisite+Certificateholder+approvals.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEstithmar+will+announce+the+results+of+the+Invitation+and+any+other+material+developments+in+accordance+with+applicable+disclosure+requirements.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BCapitalised+terms+used+but+not+otherwise+defined+in+this+announcement+shall+have+the+meanings+given+to+them+in+the+Offer+Memorandum.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BKey+Terms+and+Conditions+of+the+Invitation%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Invitation+commences+on+the+date+of+this+announcement.+The+deadline+for+receipt+by+the+Exchange+and+Tabulation+Agent+of+Exchange+Instructions+and+Voting+Instructions+from+Certificateholders+wishing+to+participate+in+the+Electronic+Consent+process+is+4%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+14+September+2026%2C+being+the+Electronic+Consent+Deadline.+If+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+is+not+passed+by+way+of+Electronic+Consent+by+the+Electronic+Consent+Deadline%2C+Exchange+Instructions+and+Voting+Instructions+may+continue+to+be+submitted+until+4%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+21+September+2026%2C+being+the+Final+Deadline%2C+in+which+case+Estithmar+intends+to+convene+the+Meeting+at+12%3A00+p.m.+%28London+time%29+on+24+September+2026+at+the+offices+of+Simmons+%26amp%3B+Simmons+LLP%2C+CityPoint%2C+One+Ropemaker+Street%2C+London+EC2Y+9SS%2C+United+Kingdom.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Notice+of+Electronic+Consent+and+Meeting+convening+the+Meeting+and+circulating+the+Extraordinary+Resolution+by+way+of+Electronic+Consent+has+been+given+to+Certificateholders+%28in+accordance+with+the+Master+Trust+Deed%29+on+the+date+of+this+announcement.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BFull+details+of+the+Exchange+Offer+and+Consent+Solicitation%2C+including+the+applicable+conditions+and+procedures+for+participation%2C+are+set+out+in+the+Offer+Memorandum+published+today%2C+which+is+available+to+eligible+holders+at+https%3A%2F%2Fdeals.is.kroll.com%2Festithmar+and+has+also+been+announced+via+the+Regulatory+News+Service+of+the+London+Stock+Exchange.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BFurther+details+about+the+Exchange+Offer%2C+the+Consent+Solicitation+and+the+Proposal+can+be+obtained+from%3A%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Exchange+and+Tabulation+Agent+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BKroll+Issuer+Services+Limited%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+News+Building+3+London+Bridge+Street+London+SE1+9SG+United+Kingdom+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BInvitation+Website%3A+https%3A%2F%2Fdeals.is.kroll.com%2Festithmar+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEmail%3A+estithmar%40is.kroll.com%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAttention%3A+Scott+Boswell%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Joint+Dealer+Managers+and+Solicitation+Agents%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAl+Rayan+Investment+L.L.C.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAlRayan+Tower%2C+Alad+Al+Sharqi+Street%2C+Lusail+P.O.+Box+28888%2C+Qatar+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BTelephone%3A+%2B974+4423+4989+%2F+%2B974+5535+5639+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEmail%3A+ariadvisory%40alrayan.com%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+Attention%3A+ARI+Advisory%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BLesha+Bank+LLC+%28Public%29+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BWest+Bay%2C+Tornado+Tower%2C+4th+Floor+PO+Box+28028%2C+Doha%2C+Qatar+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BTelephone%3A+%2B974+4448+3441+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEmail%3A+advisory%40leshabank.com++%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAttention%3A+Toufic+Fawaz%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+First+Investor+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BLusail+Marina+-+Dukhan+Bank+Tower%2C+16th+Floor+P.O.+Box+16034%2C+Doha%2C+Qatar+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BTelephone%3A+%2B+974+4448+8872%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BEmail%3A+TFIadvisory%40tfi.com.qa%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAttention%3A+TFI+Advisory++%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BOffer+and+Distribution+Restrictions%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+announcement+and+the+Offer+Memorandum+do+not+constitute+an+offer+or+an+invitation+to+participate+in+the+Invitation+in+any+jurisdiction+in+or+from+which%2C+or+to+or+from+any+person+to+or+from+whom%2C+it+is+unlawful+to+make+such+offer+or+invitation+under+applicable+securities+laws.+The+distribution+of+the+Offer+Memorandum+in+certain+jurisdictions+may+be+restricted+by+law.+Persons+into+whose+possession+the+Offer+Memorandum+comes+are+required+by+each+of+the+Trustee%2C+Estithmar%2C+the+Delegate%2C+the+Joint+Dealer+Managers%2C+the+Agents+and+the+Exchange+and+Tabulation+Agent+to+inform+themselves+about%2C+and+to+observe%2C+any+such+restrictions.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThis+announcement+has+been+authorised+for+release+by+Mr.+Ramez+MHD+Ruslan+Alkhayyat%2C+Vice+Chairman+of+Estithmar+Holding+Q.P.S.C.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D441424eb-cf70-42f6-908d-fef234490675%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-02T08%3A00%3A21%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-02T08%3A00%3A21%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46806%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3ELesha+Bank+Completes+Acquisition+of+Equity+Interests+in+Diversified+Aviation+Portfolio%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3ELesha+Bank+LLC+%28Public%29%2C+on+behalf+of+the+private+aviation+investment+fund+it+manages+and+in+accordance+with+the+Sharia+principles%2C+announced+the+acqu%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BLesha+Bank+LLC+%28Public%29%2C+on+behalf+of+the+private+aviation+investment+fund+it+manages+and+in+accordance+with+the+Sharia+principles%2C+announced+the+acquisition+of+equity+interests+in+an+aviation+asset-backed+securities+transaction+with+an+aggregate+market+value+of+approximately+USD+1.04+billion+%28equivalent+to+approximately+QAR+3.79+billion%29+from+an+aviation+lessor+and+global+asset+management+firm.+The+transaction+comprises+a+portfolio+of+18+aircraft+leased+to+various+airline+operators.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D889ad455-4086-4528-bba3-5ef0c1f61b85%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-01T20%3A14%3A38%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-01T20%3A14%3A38%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46804%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EGWC+Group+Strengthens+Frozen+Cold+Chain+Supply+into+Qatar+Through+One+of+Oman%E2%80%99s+First+Frozen+Bulk+Vessel+Operations%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EGulf+Warehousing+Company+Q.P.S.C.+%28GWC%29+announces+the+completion+of+one+of+the+first+frozen+bulk+vessel+operations+in+the+Sultanate+of+Oman%2C+strengthe%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BGulf+Warehousing+Company+Q.P.S.C.+%28GWC%29+announces+the+completion+of+one+of+the+first+frozen+bulk+vessel+operations+in+the+Sultanate+of+Oman%2C+strengthening+the+Group%E2%80%99s+cold+chain+capabilities+and+opening+a+new+supply+route+for+frozen+products+by+road+into+Qatar.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Group+has+successfully+handled%2C+stored%2C+and+distributed+more+than+1%2C000+truckloads+of+frozen+cargo+across+local+and+regional+markets%2C+including+Qatar.+The+successful+operations+also+secured+a+long-term+cold+storage+contract+with+the+customer.+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BFor+further+details%2C+please+refer+to+the+attached+press+release.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D72979502-937c-43c1-9d68-f41077965a26%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-01T20%3A14%3A15%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-01T20%3A14%3A15%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46800%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EBaladna+Q.P.S.C.+-+Rights+Issue+Subscription+Results%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EBaladna+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+the+subscription+period+for+its+rights+issue+of+535%2C996%2C240+new+ordinary+shares+at+QAR+1.01+per+share+closed+on+17+Aug%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BBaladna+Q.P.S.C.+announces+that+the+subscription+period+for+its+rights+issue+of+535%2C996%2C240+new+ordinary+shares+at+QAR+1.01+per+share+closed+on+17+August+2026%2C+and+that+the+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+has+approved+the+subscription+results+and+the+listing+of+the+new+shares.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BShares+subscribed%3A+415%2C488%2C835+shares+%2877.5%25%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BShares+unsubscribed%3A+120%2C507%2C405+%2822.5%25%29%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+subscribed+shares+will+be+registered+in+subscribers%E2%80%99+accounts+with+Edaa.+The+unsubscribed+shares+will+be+dealt+with+in+accordance+with+applicable+rules+and+regulations+and+with+the+resolution+of+the+Extraordinary+General+Assembly+of+22+July+2026.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BListing+and+commencement+of+trading+will+be+announced+separately.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-09-01T07%3A40%3A14%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-09-01T07%3A40%3A15%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46798%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EVodafone+Qatar+announced+the+establishment+of+Infinity+Signal+Services+LLC%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EVodafone+Qatar+Q.P.S.C.+%28%22Vodafone+Qatar%22+or+the+%22Company%22%29+announced+the+establishment+of+Infinity+Signal+Services+LLC%2C+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BVodafone+Qatar+Q.P.S.C.+%28%22Vodafone+Qatar%22+or+the+%22Company%22%29+announced+the+establishment+of+Infinity+Signal+Services+LLC%2C+a+wholly+owned+subsidiary+of+Vodafone+Qatar+responsible+for+the+management%2C+operation%2C+and+development+of+the+Company%E2%80%99s+telecommunications+tower+assets+and+passive+infrastructure.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+establishment+of+Infinity+Signal+Services+forms+part+of+Vodafone+Qatar%E2%80%99s+strategy+to+strengthen+its+telecommunications+infrastructure+capabilities%2C+support+future+network+growth+and+expansion%2C+enhance+operational+efficiency%2C+and+increase+the+value+of+its+telecommunications+infrastructure+assets%2C+contributing+to+the+Company%E2%80%99s+long-term+strategic+objectives+and+the+creation+of+sustainable+value+for+its+shareholders.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BVodafone+Qatar+continues+to+work+closely+with+the+relevant+regulatory+and+governmental+authorities+to+support+the+Company%E2%80%99s+activities+and+enable+it+to+contribute+to+the+development+of+Qatar%E2%80%99s+telecommunications+infrastructure+ecosystem+in+line+with+the+applicable+regulatory+framework.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dd531af2c-77bc-4d91-8f15-5a276e200df5%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-30T07%3A54%3A32%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-30T07%3A54%3A32%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3