08%2F2026+and+the+following+resolution+were+approved%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%C2%B7+Approved+the+Amendments+made+to+the+Company%E2%80%99s+Articles+of+Association%2C+including+amendments+in+accordance+with+the+Corporate+Governance+Code+issued+pursuant+to+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+Board+Resolution+No.+%285%29+of+2025%2C+which+are+Published+on+the+Company%E2%80%99s+Official+Website+%28www.nakilat.com%29%2C+and+to+authorize+the+Chairman+of+the+Board+of+Directors+to+sign+the+amended+and+Restated+Articles+of+Association+and+complete+the+required+notarization%2C+authentication%2C+and+publication+procedures+before+the+Ministry+of+Commerce+and+Industry+and+the+Ministry+of+Justice+in+the+State+of+Qatar.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dd6860154-a7a1-456d-b7fd-55c518f729e7%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-24T22%3A45%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-24T22%3A45%3A48%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46792%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Electronic+Systems+Co.+-+Techno+Q+%28Q.P.S.C.%29+%3A+Disclose+the+Semi-annual+financial+statement+of+2026%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Electronic+Systems+Co.+-+Techno+Q+%28Q.P.S.C.%29+discloses+the+financial+statement+for+the+six-month+period+ending+30th+June+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Electronic+Systems+Co.+-+Techno+Q+%28Q.P.S.C.%29+discloses+the+financial+statement+for+the+six-month+period+ending+30th+June+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+statements+revealed+a+Net+Profit+of+QR+9%2C520%2C015+in+comparison+to+Net+Profit+QR+9%2C784%2C210+for+the+same+period+of+the+previous+year.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Earnings+per+share%28EPS%29+amounted+to+QR+0.11+as+of+30th+June+%2C+2026+versus+Earnings+per+share%28EPS%29+QR+0.12+for+the+same+period+in+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bdiv+dir%3D%22ltr%22%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3D1707cd2d-bcec-4745-bd9f-bdedefd9791c%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-24T22%3A45%3A19%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-24T22%3A45%3A20%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46790%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company+%3A+The+AGM+and+EGM+Endorses+Items+on+Its+Agenda+%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company++announces+the+results+of+the+AGM+and+EGM.+The+meeting+was+held+on+23%2F08%2F2026+and+the+following+resolution+were+approv%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BAl+Meera+Consumer+Goods+Company++announces+the+results+of+the+AGM+and+EGM.+The+meeting+was+held+on+23%2F08%2F2026+and+the+following+resolution+were+approved%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22text-decoration%3A+underline%3B%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BFirst-The+Ordinary+General+Assembly+approved+the+followin%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3Bg+p%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3Bolicies%3A%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B1.+The+Board+Membership+Nomination+and+Election+Policy%2C+in+accordance+with+the+requirements+of+the+Corporate+Governance+Code+for+Listed+Companies+issued+pursuant+to+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+Decision+No.+%285%29+of+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B2.+The+Board+Members%E2%80%99+Remuneration+Policy%2C+in+accordance+with+the+requirements+of+the+Corporate+Governance+Code+for+Listed+Companies+issued+pursuant+to+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+Decision+No.+%285%29+of+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B3.+The+Related+Party+Policy%2C+in+accordance+with+the+requirements+of+the+Corporate+Governance+Code+for+Listed+Companies+issued+pursuant+to+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+Decision+No.+%285%29+of+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan+style%3D%22text-decoration%3A+underline%3B%22%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bstrong%26gt%3BSecond-+The+Extraordinary+General+Assembly+approved+the+following%3A%26lt%3B%2Fstrong%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B1.+The+amendment+of+Article+%282%29+of+the+Company%E2%80%99s+Articles+of+Association+by+adding+online+trading+activity+%28e-commerce%29+to+the+Company%E2%80%99s+objects.+It+also+approved+the+amendment+of+Articles+%288%29%2C+%2825%29%2C+%2826%29%2C+%2827%29%2C+%2830%29%2C+%2831%29%2C+%2832%29%2C+%2837%29%2C+%2839%29%2C+%2840%29%2C+%2842%29%2C+%2843%29%2C+%2850%29%2C+%2864%29%2C+%2865%29%2C+%2882%29%2C+and+%2883%29+of+the+Company%E2%80%99s+Articles+of+Association%2C+in+accordance+with+the+requirements+of+the+Corporate+Governance+Code+for+Listed+Companies+issued+pursuant+to+Qatar+Financial+Markets+Authority+Board+Decision+No.+%285%29+of+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp+style%3D%22text-align%3A+justify%3B%22%26gt%3B2.+The+authorization+of+His+Excellency+the+Chairman+of+the+Board+of+Directors+to+sign+the+amended+copies+of+the+Articles+of+Association+and+complete+the+notarization%2C+authentication%2C+and+publication+procedures+with+the+Ministry+of+Commerce+and+Industry+and+the+Ministry+of+Justice+in+the+State+of+Qatar.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-24T08%3A04%3A39%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-24T08%3A04%3A40%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46779%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EQatar+Gas+Transport+Company+Ltd.%3A+Postponed+it%27s+EGM+to+24%2F08%2F2026+due+to+lack+of+quorum+%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EQatar+Gas+Transport+Company+Ltd.+announced+that+due+to+non-legal+quorum+for+the+EGM+on+19%2F08%2F2026%2C+therefore%2C+it+has+been+decided+to+postpone+the+meet%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BQatar+Gas+Transport+Company+Ltd.+announced+that+due+to+non-legal+quorum+for+the+EGM+on+19%2F08%2F2026%2C+%26lt%3Bspan+class%3D%22%22%26gt%3Btherefore%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%2C+it+has+been+decided+to+postpone+the+meeting+to+24%2F08%2F2026%26amp%3B+04%3A00+PM%26amp%3B+electronically+using+Zoom+application+platform..%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-20T07%3A25%3A35%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-20T07%3A25%3A36%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46777%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announces+its+participation+as+part+of+an+official+delegation+in+the+visit+to+the+Federal+Republic+of+Somalia.%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announced+its+participation+in+an+official+delegation%27s+visit+to+the+Federal+Republic+of+Somalia.+The+vi%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announced+its+participation+in+an+official+delegation%27s+visit+to+the+Federal+Republic+of+Somalia.+The+visit+aimed+to+explore+trade+and+investment+opportunities+in+the+healthcare+sector%2C+learn+about+relevant+tenders+and+projects%2C+and+discuss+potential+collaborations+and+partnerships+with+governmental%2C+semi-governmental%2C+and+private+sector+entities+in+Somalia.+This+visit+is+part+of+the+company%27s+efforts+to+explore+new+markets+and+business+opportunities%2C+strengthen+its+international+presence%2C+and+increase+trade+in+the+healthcare+sector.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+company+confirms+that+there+is+currently+no+material+financial+impact+resulting+from+the+visit%2C+and+any+subsequent+material+developments+will+be+disclosed+in+accordance+with+applicable+regulations.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-19T15%3A05%3A11%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-19T15%3A05%3A11%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++++++%3CNews%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeDetailID%3E46775%3C%2FInformationTypeDetailID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationTypeID%3E1%3C%2FInformationTypeID%3E++++++++++++%3CInformationCategoryID%3E1%3C%2FInformationCategoryID%3E++++++++++++%3CHeadline%3EThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announces+the+signing+of+an+agreement+with+a+consulting+firm+to+implement+a+governance%2C+risk+management%2C+and+compliance+project.%3C%2FHeadline%3E++++++++++++%3CSummary%3EThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announced+the+signing+of+an+agreement+with+a+consulting+firm+to+implement+a+governance%2C+risk+management%2C%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Qatari+German+For+Medical+Devices+Company+announced+the+signing+of+an+agreement+with+a+consulting+firm+to+implement+a+governance%2C+risk+management%2C+and+compliance+%28GRM%29+project.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+project+aims+to+develop+and+strengthen+the+company%27s+GRM%2C+risk+management%2C+and+compliance+system%2C+and+enhance+the+efficiency+of+its+corporate+controls+and+procedures%2C+thereby+supporting+improved+corporate+performance+and+adherence+to+regulatory+requirements+and+best+practices.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublish