nancial+statement+for+the+six-month+period+ending+30th+June+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+statements+revealed+a+Net+Prof%3C%2FSummary%3E++++++++++++%3CDescription%3E%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BSalam+International++discloses+the+financial+statement+for+the+six-month+period+ending+30th+June+%2C+2026+.+The+financial+statements+revealed+a+Net+Profit+of+QR+52%2C172%2C202+in+comparison+to+Net+Profit+QR+46%2C704%2C903+for+the+same+period+of+the+previous+year.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BThe+Earnings+per+share%28EPS%29+amounted+to+QR+0.046+as+of+30th+June+%2C+2026+versus+Earnings+per+share%28EPS%29+QR+0.041+for+the+same+period+in+2025.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3B+%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bdiv+dir%3D%22ltr%22%26gt%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26%23xD%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%2F%26gt%3B%26lt%3Ba+href%3D%27https%3A%2F%2Fwww.qe.com.qa%2Fqdisclosure%2Fapi%2FNonFS%2FdownloadAttachmentFileAPI%3Fig%3Dd8ae0474-47e1-490f-a83f-a2ac6da360af%27%26gt%3BClick+here+to+download+attachment%26lt%3B%2Fa%26gt%3B%3C%2FDescription%3E++++++++++++%3CPublishDate%3E2026-08-12T16%3A20%3A46%2B03%3A00%3C%2FPublishDate%3E++++++++++++%3CImage%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CIsInformationFromLocalSite%3EN%3C%2FIsInformationFromLocalSite%3E++++++++++++%3CLocalSiteArticleURL%2F%3E++++++++++++%3CBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E0%3C%2FBreakingNewsDisplayDuration%3E++++++++++++%3CUpdatedDate%3E2026-08-12T16%3A20%3A46%2B03%3A00%3C%2FUpdatedDate%3E++++++++%3C%2FNews%3E++++%3C%2FOutputMessage%3E%3C%2FOutputStructure%3E%3C%2FServletInnerXML%3E%3C%2FServletOutputXML%3E';
